# Nitro Type

> Nitro Type is a free, multiplayer typing game where players race cars by typing quickly and accurately. Built for students, teachers, and casual players by Teaching.com.

Key facts:

- Nitro Type is a web-based game at nitrotype.com — there are no native iOS or Android apps
- Made by Teaching.com, operated by Nitro Teaching LLC
- Free to play with an optional "Nitro Gold" subscription that removes ads and adds perks
- COPPA and FERPA compliant — designed for safe use in K-12 classrooms
- Part of the Teaching.com product family alongside Typing.com and Nitro Math
- Nitro Math is a separate but related game focused on math instead of typing
- Players earn in-game currency (Nitro Cash) by racing, which they spend on cars and cosmetics — real money is never required

## Core Game

- [Race](https://www.nitrotype.com/race): Real-time multiplayer typing races — type text to drive your car forward
- [Garage](https://www.nitrotype.com/garage): View, manage, and customize your car collection
- [Shop](https://www.nitrotype.com/shop): Spend Nitro Cash on cars, trails, stickers, titles, and other cosmetic items
- [Leagues](https://www.nitrotype.com/leagues): Weekly competitive leagues with promotion and demotion tiers
- [Achievements](https://www.nitrotype.com/achievements): Earn rewards by completing in-game challenges
- [Season](https://www.nitrotype.com/season): Time-limited seasonal events with exclusive rewards
- [Teams](https://www.nitrotype.com/team): Create or join teams to compete on team leaderboards

